OL,3,ARosenberg: Russia's elections will have
OL,4,Afew surprises, but for the Kremlin they
OL,5,Amatter
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe system of power in Russia is often
OL,8,Freferred to as "managed democracy"
OL,9,F(where the Kremlin does the managing).
OL,11,FThat means huge powers for the
OL,12,Fpresident and few political surprises.
OL,14,FThis weekend's election is set to
OL,15,Fdeliver another parliament dominated by
OL,16,Fthe party of power, United Russia, and
OL,17,Fa house of MPs fiercely loyal to
OL,18,FVladimir Putin.
OL,20,FCritics dismiss the vote as neither
OL,21,Ffree nor fair.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
